--- !u!114 &1818432483
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1818432482}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c64bcc9600fbd264194d7878f5f553fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  postDialogue0:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258047
    - rid: 2124643721081258048
    - rid: 2124643721081258054
    - rid: 2124643982316142592
    - rid: 2124643982316142593
    - rid: 2124643982316142594
    - rid: 2124643982316142595
    - rid: 2124643982316142596
    - rid: 2124643982316142597
  dialogue1:
  - content: Ives?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258052
  - content: Headquarters placed your daughter under my watch. Odd way to say you
      need a babysitter, don't you think?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258053
    - rid: 2124643721081258141
  - content: What? I don't know what you're-
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258142
  - content: <i>Deception.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1e2e094931ab49479e4bf2319b9f492, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258143
  - content: Save it, Ailin. What's going on? First Jay goes missing, now you're
      flaking on me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258144
  - content: <i>Ailin's gaze falters.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258145
  - content: The team's going out to find Jay, first thing tomorrow.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258146
  - content: What? Without me?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258147
  - content: I need you here for Jackie.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258157
  - content: <i>Worthless.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1e2e094931ab49479e4bf2319b9f492, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258148
  - content: Someone-<i>anyone</i>-else could do that! Let me come, Ailin! Jay is
      my comrade too.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258149
  - content: Do you not believe in me, after all we've been through?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Of course I do... That's why I need you here!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258150
  - content: If anything happens to us out there... If we don't make it back... Jackie
      will need you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: You're the only one I trust with her, Ives.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258151
  - content: What about <i>you</i>? You're her mother.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I know, but... I\u2019m the one who sent Jay out there. I have to find
      him. Please, Ives. Please just do this for me."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea1ccd6a87516a42b4a830ac3f980a1, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258152
  - content: <i>Pathetic.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1e2e094931ab49479e4bf2319b9f492, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258153
  - content: "...You\u2019d better come back. I won\u2019t play babysitter forever."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258155
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643982316142667
  dialogue2:
  - content: "Sir, her heart rate is stabilizing. But her arm, it\u2019s still\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258069
    - rid: 2124643982316142598
    - rid: 2124643982316142600
    - rid: 2124643982316142603
  - content: "I understand. But for now, there\u2019s not much else we can do."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258070
    - rid: 2124643982316142601
    - rid: 2124643982316142602
  - content: "Her natural Amplitude levels are subsid\xADing, which should help curb
      the spread. As long as her \r\nvitals are stable, she should wake up soon."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643982316142604
  dialogue3:
  - content: Cam...?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258071
    - rid: 2124643721081258072
  - content: "Ah! Ives, thank goodness. You\u2019re awake. Your infection was...
      it got pretty bad."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258073
  - content: "We\u2019re back at the base. This is Dr. Weise, he\u2019s been overseeing
      your recovery."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258074
  - content: "Commander Ives. I\u2019m Dr. Aleksander Weise. A relief to see you
      conscious."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258075
    - rid: 2124643721081258076
    - rid: 2124643721081258162
    - rid: 2124643982316142668
  - content: "...Where\u2019s Jackie?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258077
    - rid: 2124643721081258078
  - content: "She\u2019s safe. Still in the Tundra. She wouldn\u2019t leave your
      side until we had you on the WRV."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258079
    - rid: 2124643721081258080
  - content: "She\u2019s... There was a look in her eyes, Ives. She\u2019s determined
      to stay."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Good. ...How long until I\u2019m cleared? I need to get back out there."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258081
    - rid: 2124643721081258082
  - content: Uh...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258083
    - rid: 2124643721081258084
  - content: "I\u2019m afraid that won\u2019t be possible, Commander."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258085
    - rid: 2124643721081258086
  - content: And why is that?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258087
  - content: Although your condition has stabilized, the Waste vectors in your system
      exhibited... an unfortunate reaction.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258088
    - rid: 2124643721081258089
  - content: To explain briefly, you must understand that all living beings transform
      energy to a specific unique <i>Frequency</i> signature before they are able
      to expend it for themselves.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: When the waste binds to biology, it feeds on this transformed energy
      to replicate itself.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Thus it is imperative to neutralize it with the Anti-Waste serum before
      it becomes pervasive.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The way the Serum does this is by taking advantage of a major property
      of the Waste.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The Waste is naturally inclined to bind with objects of higher energy
      frequencies.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And so the Anti-Waste Serum is synthesized using special materials to
      have a very high frequency, higher than any natural biology found on earth.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258090
  - content: As a result, when you receive the serum, the Waste binds to the serum
      instead of the body.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258091
  - content: In addition, to ensure the Waste has insufficient energy to consume
      and replicate, we also ensure the energy signatures of the Serum have very
      low <i>Amplitude</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: However, something in the Tundra compromised the serum, causing its
      amplitude to spike.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Instead of neutralizing the Waste vectors, the injection acted as a
      catalyst for its spread instead.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The vector has spread through your entire system. To an extent where
      it is no longer feasible to purge.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258092
  - content: "I\u2019m afraid the infection is permanent."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258093
  - content: ...How bad is it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258094
  - content: "It\u2019s not terminal."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258095
    - rid: 2124643721081258096
  - content: But when the Waste consumes Amplitude, it increases the <i>Frequency</i>
      of the transformer energy as a byproduct.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258097
  - content: "This will disrupt your body\u2019s natural ability to utilize energy,
      and cause major complications."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: While we can manage the symptoms with suppressants and infusions, you
      will grow weaker.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Any significant physical exertion, especially in the field, will increase
      the amount of energy your body transforms.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And will drastically accelerate the Waste's spread.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258098
  - content: "I\u2019m gonna be out there as long as I can. I have to be there for
      Jackie."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258099
  - content: "Put me on the next re-supply transport. That\u2019s an order, Doctor."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258100
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258101
  - content: "Ives, you can\u2019t-"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258102
    - rid: 2124643721081258103
  - content: As you wish, Commander. I will prepare a regimen of our strongest suppressants.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258104
    - rid: 2124643721081258105
  - content: "Reichel? A word in my lab, when you\u2019re ready."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  postDialogue3:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258106
    - rid: 2124643721081258107
  dialogue4:
  - content: "Ives... I\u2019m so sorry..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258108
    - rid: 2124643721081258109
  - content: "Don\u2019t you start pitying me, kid. We both know this had nothing
      to do with you."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258110
    - rid: 2124643721081258111
  - content: But it was my invention that failed to protect us... failed you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258112
  - content: Hey, I knew the risks. All of us did.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258113
  - content: Far as I see it, your invention got the NITES further than anyone else
      ever has. One step closer to Ailin. One step closer to the truth.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But I should\u2019ve known about the reaction, about the Frog. If only
      I knew more..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258114
    - rid: 2124643721081258115
  - content: "Hah, I\u2019m sure if you had known, we wouldn\u2019t have been able
      to step out that morning."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258116
    - rid: 2124643721081258117
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258118
  - content: "Listen, I get it. That terrible feeling of \u2018what could\u2019 if
      you had <b>just known</b>..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258123
    - rid: 2124643721081258124
  - content: "But you didn\u2019t. No one did. Hell, if there was someone who knew,
      I\u2019d like to have some words with them."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258122
  - content: So no one, especially not you, can blame you for not knowing.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But it\u2019s my job as a Scientist to know! My whole life has been
      spent pursuing the Waste to help people... and for what... to end up hurting
      those closest to me?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258125
    - rid: 2124643721081258126
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258127
    - rid: 2124643721081258128
  - content: Cam. I need you to understand something.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258138
  - content: "I know you feel like shit right now. Like you\u2019re not enough."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019ve been there, kid. Walked that line to the end and back."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258122
  - content: But you know where that damn feeling of inadequacy comes from?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258122
  - content: "From an expectation that you\u2019ve set for <i>yourself.</i>"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Of what it looks like to be some ideal scientist or NITES or whatever.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "So when those expectations aren\u2019t met, that person you think you
      should be calls you worthless."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But the you that everyone else sees is not the same as that one in your
      head.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258129
  - content: "No one\u2019s blaming you. I don\u2019t blame you. And I never will."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "The only person who\u2019s blaming you is yourself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258130
  - content: "So make peace with yourself. What\u2019s done is done."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Accept that it\u2019s okay to not quite be where you want to be right
      now."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Because if you keep focusing on where you\u2019ve tripped up, you\u2019ll
      never fully trust yourself to stand straight and walk forward again."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: To become that person you truly want to be.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258131
  - content: Got it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Cam stays silent for a while, and eventually just nods.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258132
  - content: So, what are you going to do now?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258133
    - rid: 2124643721081258134
  - content: "I\u2019m going to get some answers. I promise."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2124643721081258136
    - rid: 2124643721081258137
  - content: Damn straight you are.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
